OL,3,GNEWSAStones misses speeding letter
OL,4,Awhile at World Cup
OL,5,
OL,6,FFootballer John Stones has been
OL,7,Fconvicted of speeding after he missed a
OL,8,Fpolice letter while at the World Cup
OL,9,Fwith England.
OL,11,FThe 32-year-old defender, who left
OL,12,FManchester City for Inter Milan in the
OL,13,Fsummer, was caught driving his #150,000
OL,14,FRange Rover at 43mph (69 km/h) along a
OL,15,F30 mph (48 km/h) stretch of a country
OL,16,Flane near his Cheshire home in May.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,409,400,260,160,0,100
