OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAStones misses speeding letter
OL,4,Awhile at World Cup
OL,5,
OL,6,FStones admitted being the driver when
OL,7,Ffirst contacted by Cheshire Police, but
OL,8,Fdid not respond to a second letter
OL,9,Foffering him the chance to pay a fixed
OL,10,Fpenalty to keep the speeding offence
OL,11,Fout of court.
OL,13,FHe wrote to Warrington Magistrates
OL,14,FCourt to explain he had been abroad but
OL,15,Fwas landed with a #1,052 court bill. He
OL,16,Fwas given four points.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
